<note id="098b2f1e-5567-4a73-9055-839d4f361c04" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-16 13:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-18 09:45:12" subject="Code Review Guidelines">
<description>
Review checklist:
- Does it solve the stated problem?
- Are there adequate tests?
- Is error handling appropriate?
- Are there potential security issues?
- Is the code readable without excessive comments?
- Does it follow existing patterns in the codebase?

Response time SLA: Review within 24 business hours
Max PR size: 400 lines (excluding generated files)
</description>
</note>
<note id="0b0d69a0-1731-4dba-9ef2-424add510daf" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-13 10:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-15 14:22:33" subject="Database Migration Checklist">
<description>
Pre-migration:
- Backup all production data
- Test migration script on staging
- Notify users of maintenance window
- Prepare rollback plan

During migration:
- Enable maintenance mode
- Run migration scripts
- Verify data integrity
- Run smoke tests

Post-migration:
- Monitor error rates for 24 hours
- Check query performance metrics
</description>
</note>
<note id="219d4064-2b6d-457d-a535-97957a6a918c" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-11 14:30:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-12 10:05:00" subject="Client Feedback - Sprint Review">
<description>
Client likes the new dashboard layout.
Requested changes:
- Add export to PDF button on reports page
- Make sidebar collapsible on mobile
- Increase font size in data tables
- Add dark mode toggle (low priority)
Next review: February 5th
</description>
</note>
<note id="2278ed33-4370-4526-8645-38de611d0efa" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-14 11:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-20 16:10:44" subject="Useful Git Commands">
<description>
Frequently used commands:
- git log --oneline --graph --all
- git stash push -m "description"
- git rebase -i HEAD~3
- git bisect start/bad/good
- git reflog (recover lost commits)
- git cherry-pick commit-hash

Branch naming: feature/TICKET-123-short-description
Commit format: type(scope): description
</description>
</note>
<note id="40785ee2-048c-44b5-bdc5-5ce7a9775e2d" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-10 09:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-10 09:35:21" subject="Weekly Team Standup Notes">
<description>
Monday standup summary:
- Frontend team blocked on API endpoint documentation
- Backend migration to PostgreSQL 16 on track
- QA found 3 critical bugs in checkout flow
- Design review scheduled for Wednesday 2pm
Action items: Update API docs by Tuesday EOD
</description>
</note>
<note id="459811a9-d35a-4838-b8a8-da1a8da66032" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-19 11:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-21 15:30:18" subject="Performance Optimization Notes">
<description>
Bottlenecks identified (Jan profiling):
1. N+1 queries on /api/projects endpoint (fix: eager loading)
2. Unindexed search on user_sessions table
3. Large JSON serialization for activity feed
4. Synchronous email sending in request cycle

Quick wins implemented:
- Added composite index on (user_id, created_at)
- Moved email sending to background queue
- Added response compression (gzip)
Result: p95 latency reduced from 1.2s to 340ms
</description>
</note>
<note id="4d8a4161-4880-4e41-a08c-749915b82530" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-20 14:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-22 11:20:05" subject="Incident Postmortem - Jan 19 Outage">
<description>
Duration: 45 minutes (14:15 - 15:00 UTC)
Impact: 100% of users unable to log in
Root cause: Expired TLS certificate on auth service

Timeline:
- 14:15 Monitoring alert fired
- 14:20 On-call engineer acknowledged
- 14:35 Root cause identified
- 14:45 Certificate renewed and deployed
- 15:00 Service fully restored

Action items:
- Set up certificate expiry monitoring (30-day warning)
- Add TLS cert renewal to automated pipeline
</description>
</note>
<note id="55b8a81d-af9e-48d8-89b2-656f9242d275" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-22 10:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-23 08:15:47" subject="Deployment Runbook - Production">
<description>
Pre-deploy:
1. Ensure all CI checks pass on main
2. Check for pending database migrations
3. Notify #deployments Slack channel

Deploy steps:
1. Tag release: git tag v1.x.x
2. Push tag to trigger deploy pipeline
3. Monitor deploy progress in ArgoCD
4. Watch error rates in Datadog (5 min)

Rollback:
1. kubectl rollout undo deployment/app
2. Notify team in Slack
3. Create incident ticket if user-impacting
</description>
</note>
<note id="7f0ff34a-0dd2-4db9-8166-88296e1db0f8" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-17 10:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-19 13:40:29" subject="API Versioning Strategy">
<description>
Current: v1 (stable, no breaking changes planned)
Next: v2 (breaking changes for user endpoints)

Versioning approach: URL path prefix (/api/v1/, /api/v2/)
Deprecation policy: 6 months notice before removal
Migration guide required for all breaking changes
</description>
</note>
<note id="9b37b774-4f45-4c81-b9ac-5f1048bad92a" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-18 08:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-22 14:55:33" subject="Onboarding Checklist - New Developers">
<description>
Day 1:
- Set up development environment
- Clone repositories and run build
- Read architecture overview doc
- Meet with team lead

Week 1:
- Complete codebase walkthrough
- Fix a good-first-issue bug
- Set up monitoring access
- Join relevant Slack channels
</description>
</note>
<note id="9dec0141-e228-4097-b8cd-0b4f48a96637" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-14 16:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-17 11:08:12" subject="Server Monitoring Thresholds">
<description>
Alert thresholds (PagerDuty):
- CPU over 80% for 5 minutes: Warning
- CPU over 95% for 2 minutes: Critical
- Memory over 85%: Warning
- Disk over 90%: Critical
- Response time over 2s (p95): Warning
- Error rate over 5%: Critical

Dashboard: grafana.internal/dashboards
</description>
</note>
<note id="e130de32-125c-455e-806d-8f90a72db17a" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-21 09:00:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-21 10:45:00" subject="Sprint Retrospective - Sprint 14">
<description>
What went well:
- Shipped auth feature on time
- Good collaboration between frontend and backend
- Zero production incidents

What to improve:
- PRs sitting too long in review queue
- Flaky integration tests causing CI delays

Actions:
- Implement review lottery system
- Quarantine flaky tests, fix in dedicated sprint
- Break stories into max 3-day chunks
</description>
</note>
<note id="e5b07193-435a-47f0-987e-dea0cf4c32f2" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-12 08:15:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-14 09:30:55" subject="Architecture Decision: Caching Strategy">
<description>
Options considered:
1. Redis (distributed, fast, but extra infrastructure)
2. In-memory LRU cache (simple, per-instance only)
3. CDN-level caching (good for static assets)

Decision: Redis for session data and API responses.
In-memory LRU for computed values within request lifecycle.
CDN for all static assets with 24h TTL.
</description>
</note>
<note id="e6e9bf3d-ea36-447b-93f8-7c8ff4820fd3" status="1" creationDateTime="2026-01-20 16:30:00" modificationDateTime="2026-01-21 17:05:22" subject="Design System Color Tokens">
